  "solution": "**Given:** \n\n120 div [ {(2)/(3) × ( {1 - (2)/(5)} ) × 5} ] + [ {(9)/(8) of (4)/(3) div (3)/(4) of (2)/(3)} ]\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below\n\n \n \n\n **B**\n **Brackets in order (), {}, []**\n \n \n\n **O**\n **of**\n \n \n\n **D**\n **Division (÷)**\n \n \n\n **M**\n **Multiplication (×)**\n \n \n\n **A**\n **Addition (+)**\n \n \n\n **S**\n \n \n**Subtraction (-)**\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n120 div [ {(2)/(3) × ( {1 - (2)/(5)} ) × 5} ] + [ {(9)/(8) of (4)/(3) div (3)/(4) of (2)/(3)} ]\n\n120 ÷ [2/3 × 3/5 × 5] + [9/8 × 4/3 ÷ 3/4 × 2/3]\n\n120 ÷ 2 + [36/24 × 12/6]\n\n60 + 3 = 63\n\n**∴ **120** div [ {(2)/(3) × ( {1 - (2)/(5)} ) × 5} ] + [ {(9)/(8) of (4)/(3) div (3)/(4) of (2)/(3)} ]**= 63\n\nc0:T",
